  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the implementation of the Peace Agreement in rural areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to a successful implementation of the points of the peace agreement related to Rural Education and to the Reincorporation of members of FARC to civil life by ensuring that demobilised youth and adults from FARC as well as conflict-affected out-of-school children and youth (6 to 28 years old)  in the host communities effectively gain competences and skills that may contribute to peacebuilding by improving access to and retention in the education system</narrative>
  </description>
